> ### Name: HQreg
> ### Title: Robust Elastic Net Regression (Huber/Quantile Loss)
> ### Aliases: HQreg
> ### Keywords: regression robust
> 
> ### ** Examples
> 
> ## Not run: 
> ##D # Simulated data with outliers
> ##D set.seed(123)
> ##D n <- 100; p <- 10
> ##D x <- matrix(rnorm(n*p), n, p)
> ##D y <- x[,1] + 2*x[,2] + rnorm(n)
> ##D y[1:5] <- y[1:5] + 10  # Add outliers
> ##D 
> ##D # Fit robust elastic net with Huber loss
> ##D fit <- HQreg(x, y, alpha = 0.5, method = 'huber')
> ##D fit$coef
> ##D 
> ##D # Fit robust quantile regression (median)
> ##D fit_med <- HQreg(x, y, alpha = 1, method = 'quantile', tau = 0.5)
> ## End(Not run)
